1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,700
Às minhas ordens.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,956
Quatrocentos!

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,403
Somos só sessenta.

4
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:09,921
Não a entrada,

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,875
o canal.

6
00:00:11,947 --> 00:00:13,189
Quatrocentos,

7
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:14,741
passam pelo canal.

8
00:00:14,798 --> 00:00:16,321
Missão de defesa:

9
00:00:16,396 --> 00:00:19,828
nenhuma mulher ou criança perdida.

10
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:20,688
Sacos de cal,

11
00:00:20,743 --> 00:00:21,900
um a cada três passos.

12
00:00:21,966 --> 00:00:23,629
Buraco tão raso?

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,060
Não precisa.

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,159
Basta tropeçar.

15
00:00:26,227 --> 00:00:26,904
Fila da frente, abaixa!

16
00:00:27,111 --> 00:00:29,447
Parados até eu mandar.

17
00:00:29,511 --> 00:00:30,860
Xiaotang, cuide das mulheres e crianças.

18
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,532
E você, fica onde?

19
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:33,421
Desce.

20
00:00:33,714 --> 00:00:35,630
Aqui morre gente.

21
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:36,815
Eu fico aqui,

22
00:00:36,879 --> 00:00:38,167
com você.

23
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:40,873
Avancem!

24
00:00:40,934 --> 00:00:42,774
O grão é todo nosso!

25
00:00:43,002 --> 00:00:44,141
Espera.

26
00:00:44,202 --> 00:00:44,982
Joguem!

27
00:00:50,202 --> 00:00:51,178
O que é isso!

28
00:00:53,694 --> 00:00:55,093
As tochas apagaram!

29
00:00:59,989 --> 00:01:01,663
Cadê o mano?

30
00:01:01,734 --> 00:01:02,514
Entra um,

31
00:01:02,898 --> 00:01:03,493
cai um.

32
00:01:03,774 --> 00:01:04,774
Fora!

33
00:01:09,374 --> 00:01:10,502
Nenhum entrou!

34
00:01:13,451 --> 00:01:14,750
A lâmina de Diao Qi,

35
00:01:14,807 --> 00:01:16,016
Saiam da frente!

36
00:01:16,074 --> 00:01:16,708
Lâmina,

37
00:01:16,764 --> 00:01:17,642
no chão.

38
00:01:22,715 --> 00:01:23,588
Amarra!

39
00:01:23,656 --> 00:01:24,757
Pro celeiro!

40
00:01:24,821 --> 00:01:26,021
Você não fugiu.

41
00:01:26,496 --> 00:01:27,724
Falei que ficava.

42
00:01:27,786 --> 00:01:30,909
Qin Shuang: afeição, quarenta e oito.

43
00:01:30,988 --> 00:01:33,107
Missão cumprida.

44
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,522
Mano!

45
00:01:36,933 --> 00:01:37,608
Xiaohe?

46
00:01:37,792 --> 00:01:38,454
Xiaohe!
